@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-51 - Complete Return Request

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Purchases / Returns UI" as FE
control "ReturnsController" as API
control "ReturnsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: returnRequests, bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-51
FE -> API: PATCH /returns/:id/status
API -> Service: Execute Complete Return Request
Service -> DB: Read/write returnRequests, bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Return status = COMPLETED

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Return status = PROCESSING
Post: Return status = COMPLETED
Main flow:
1. Sau khi xử lý xong (hoàn tiền/đổi hàng)
2. Admin bấm Complete
3. System gọi API PATCH /returns/:id/status { status: COMPLETED }
4. System gửi email cho user
5. Return được đóng
end note
@enduml
